  "details": "I love the calendar feature and the fact that you can create events. However, I cannot rely solely on the calendar to remind me of events because I cannot customize reminder notifications to go off a certain amount of time before the event starts, like I can on a regular google calendar.\n\nWithout it, I often forget about an event entirely until I am reminded the moment it starts, and then I'm 30 minutes late because I need to get my trackers on, or I'm already out and about doing something else because I didn't plan around it. Because of this, I still add it to my google calendar so I can have notifications in advance.\n\nIf we added this feature, it would allow me to rely more heavily on the calendar system.\n\nDo note that it would be great to have multiple customizable reminders prior to the event starts, just like in google calendar. So I can choose to be reminded a month in advance AND a week in advance AND an hour before for events that are far off.",
